comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-07T22:52:07.806Z",codex-sol,"Comparison receipt: standalone pm-linked graph acceptance passed at 2513 ms; npm run release:check failed the 10000 ms read budget at 10959 ms; bun run release:check passed that same assertion at 8297 ms. Both full runs executed 493 tests with zero skips. Root cause is unproven; investigate suite instrumentation and read cost without changing thresholds. Existing fixture failures are separately tracked in pm-web-cqwm and pm-web-sspv."
  "2026-10-10T03:00:46.447Z",codex-sol,"SDK update candidate full unchanged coverage run fails large-corpus graph acceptance before reaching its 10000 ms assertion: the generatedAt parity assertion exceeds its 30000 ms tolerance. Whole test duration is 118193 ms, including fixture generation, so that is not a measured graph-read duration. Small generated graph parity and deterministic concurrent-create tests pass. Preserve both timing assertions; raw failed-run coverage is 90.04% statements/lines, 79.50% branches, 92.33% functions and no accepted coverage receipt remains."
  "2026-10-10T03:17:08.699Z",codex-sol,"Prior full run failed a 30-second cross-call timestamp tolerance before checking measured read latency. Standalone unchanged baseline reads 2000 real items in 6355 ms (2022 nodes, 23063 edges); total 21099 ms includes construction. Validate generatedAt against actual operation windows and check the unchanged 10000 ms read limit before payload parity. No production deadline or coverage inventory changes."
  "2026-10-10T03:23:17.622Z",codex-sol,"Focused combined acceptance exposes the unchanged read limit directly: 10918 ms, rejected (original standalone 6355 ms). Installed SDK source and declarations show listAllItemMetadataLight delegates to the same canonical candidate ordering as the full reader while skipping heavy collection hydration. Use light rows only for ID ordering; graph payloads still come exclusively from certified full rows, under the same workspace lock and external-writer guard. Real 2000-item full/light ordering equality and original payload/interleaving regressions are required. Serialize coverage test files to avoid suite fanout competing with its own latency measurement; retain every test, source and threshold."
  "2026-10-10T03:23:59.234Z",codex-sol,"Focused green after the public light ordering reader: 2/2 pass, zero skips; real queued/external writer guards pass, actual 2000-item read5586ms,2022nodes,23063relationships; full/light SDK ID ordering deep-equal. Prior combined full-reader run10918ms rejected by unchanged10000ms limit. Run complete serial coverage gate next; no capacity or deployment claim."
  "2026-10-10T04:08:06.156Z",codex-sol,"Verification receipt is recorded in docs/sdk-update-automation.md and linked from pm-web-8pml: complete release490/490,zero skips; packed npm/nativeBun4/4, six real disposablePostgreSQL collaboration tests. Keep item unclosed for independent orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-10T05:01:03.067Z",codex-sol,"PR #182 npm-link repair coverage rerun on unchanged graph source: 2000-item certified read measured 15811 ms, returning 2022 nodes and 23063 relationships, and correctly failed the retained 10000 ms assertion. Whole test duration 49518 ms includes fixture generation and is not read latency. Earlier base 4ff3ec receipt measured 3230 ms. No graph source, test deadline or threshold change; this known intermittent quality boundary prevents accepting the current coverage run. Catalog repair remains owned by pm-web-s99c; retain companion pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10 crosslinks."
  "2026-10-10T05:03:43.118Z",codex-sol,"Existing focused linked large-corpus check passes after packed installation completes: 1/1, zero skips, actual certified read 4495 ms, 2022 nodes and 23063 relationships; whole test 13267 ms includes generation. Same graph source and unchanged 10000 ms limit. Preserve the full instrumented-suite 15811 ms failure as a separate receipt; focused success does not accept that coverage run."
  "2026-10-10T05:13:11.676Z",codex-sol,"Final unchanged instrumented coverage retry passes 492/492 with zero skips after packed installation completes; actual 2000-item read 3257 ms (2022 nodes, 23063 relationships), within the original 10000 ms assertion. Keep prior full-suite 15811 ms failure and focused 4495 ms success as distinct receipts; no source, timing threshold or assertion edit. This bounded pass does not establish capacity or remove the intermittent-timing owner. Release claim, leave in progress for independent verification."
